{"about_the_game":"Venture to the Vile is a spooky 2.5D Metroidvania set in the strange town of Rainybrook, which has been overrun by a mysterious entity known as the Vile.<br><br>Absorb the Vile\u2019s powers, fight through treacherous grounds that were once your home, and find your lost friend Ella before it\u2019s too late!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2.5D ACTION-PACKED PLATFORMER</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/d1404192b3a2eee05ad8322237552bb1.poster.avif?t=1716384118\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/d1404192b3a2eee05ad8322237552bb1.webm?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/d1404192b3a2eee05ad8322237552bb1.mp4?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Jump, swing, and fight your way through dangerous enemies as you explore a carefully crafted 2.5D world full of puzzles to solve and secrets to discover. Unlock new abilities to overcome the Vile\u2019s monstrosities \u2014 even if it means losing your humanity.<br><br>Every new ability helps you uncover new dynamic areas, find new unique bosses, 2.5D environments to explore, and be rewarded with upgrades as you go.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY-RICH WORLD TO EXPLORE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/8884bfa6e22771c6c8a50e0f2f8645ee.poster.avif?t=1716384118\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/8884bfa6e22771c6c8a50e0f2f8645ee.webm?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/8884bfa6e22771c6c8a50e0f2f8645ee.mp4?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the quaint seaside town of Rainybrook which has been infested with the Vile\u2019s monsters. Meet the good yet peculiar townsfolk, help them with various quests to discover their stories, and uncover clues that might lead to your lost friend Ella.<br><br>The ending of this story is up to you - will you solve the mystery and best the Vile? Whether it\u2019s helping the townsfolk with unusual sidequests or discovering hidden secrets in the world around, there\u2019s more than meets the eye in the haunting and mysterious Rainybrook.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE ON ENEMIES LIKE YOU\u2019VE NEVER SEEN BEFORE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/21b60dc8b3eb41b8e7294ee0b41e99f9.poster.avif?t=1716384118\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/21b60dc8b3eb41b8e7294ee0b41e99f9.webm?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/21b60dc8b3eb41b8e7294ee0b41e99f9.mp4?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you prepared to take on the monsters of the Vile? Every boss fight is unique and will require the use of everything you\u2019ve learned so far.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re taking on a Kraken on the ghost ship or being chased through the hospital by a giant hare, you\u2019ll need to use all your abilities and upgrades to your advantage to best every new enemy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC INTERACTIVE WORLD</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/2ea1bfe3146bd348d8372a597e616189.poster.avif?t=1716384118\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/2ea1bfe3146bd348d8372a597e616189.webm?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/2ea1bfe3146bd348d8372a597e616189.mp4?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience an interactive world with Day/Night cycles and dynamic weather that will impact the game in different ways.  Encounter different monsters at night!  Seek out items and side quests that only appear under specific conditions!<br><br>Discover the many hidden effects triggered by dynamic weather, day/night cycles, and more. Side quests, items, and more will unlock at certain times or under specific conditions, so there will always be something new to explore and discover. <br><br>Want to play the game in a fresh way? Unlockable outfits shape the way you play the game, from outfits that increase difficulty to others that change the amount of loot you\u2019re likely to encounter. <br><br>Can you overcome the Vile in every outfit? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/b686d2e96ce8d39fc675a3718fd3ed91.poster.avif?t=1716384118\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/b686d2e96ce8d39fc675a3718fd3ed91.webm?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/extras/b686d2e96ce8d39fc675a3718fd3ed91.mp4?t=1716384118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Broken antler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/1cdc64da9786bbe0579aa4b9a192c0fbb011c36f.jpg"},{"name":"Saviour of Rainybrook","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/509d04fa443907182313fcd1075019d72e815bf2.jpg"},{"name":"The Black Hills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/df10f26860a74397462043181ab376f2efc2c3da.jpg"},{"name":"The Depths","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/ef0301c09d685b33ac5086344e5b41886e0e7690.jpg"},{"name":"Butcher of Rainybrook","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/661e6960246b873f1d2a6cd7c2a35daf91ca08fc.jpg"},{"name":"The end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/904a8bdeb24fda4816a86887c8b1d307cfdb4b69.jpg"},{"name":"Wonderfully monstrous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/a7a619841de91c1fa8f4a77c1415799ccdbc83c8.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky beggar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/f073909033963286d0ce5b03c6caf78103fb2e57.jpg"},{"name":"School's out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/3b89a60c3534e1282fa8794cd794b3297d40fa6b.jpg"},{"name":"Collar felt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2153750/5e7be9666c031a4e53a1069972a394f430e12029.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2153750?t=1716384118","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2153750?t=1716384118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1716384118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1716384118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam